# Hindsight Hermes integration runtime dependencies (mode: local_external).
#
# Generate the hash lock against the pinned Python 3.14 base and verify hashes at build time.
# After updating a pin, follow the in-container regeneration procedure in README.md.
#
# hindsight-embed is intentionally NOT listed: it is only imported by the
# plugin's local_embedded daemon path (`embedded.py::_start_daemon`, reached
# from `_new_embedded_client`), never for local_external. See the plugin's
# `is_available()`: local_external returns True without probing the embedded
# runtime. Add it back only if the mode ever changes to local_embedded.
hindsight-client==0.10.2
